WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Alicia Gomez: Workshop satisfaction scores came in at four point six out of five, our highest this year.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Maria Chen: What feedback did we get on the goal-setting module specifically?

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Alicia Gomez: A few managers asked for a shorter template, the current one felt long for smaller teams.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Maria Chen: Let's simplify that section before the next cohort and keep the recognition section as is.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Alicia Gomez: I'll have a revised template ready before the next session in six weeks.
